6,Music | Taichi Kunigami,https://taichikunigami.bandcamp.com/music,"Kunigami Taichi A guitarist and composer based in Japan, Kunigami Taichi performs at festivals in London and abroad. He creates a unique musical world by incorporating natural sounds and field recordings, delivering immersive ""one-man orchestra"" performances using guitar and synthesizers.",Kunigami,Japonic
